    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17981" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτουργ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be an</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτουργός,</span>
			<i>work with one's own hand,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hierocl.
				p.63A.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DMar.</u>
				6.1
			</span></i>; of the Creator, <i>to be his own workman,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Theol.Plat.</u>
				5.17
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				18
			</span></i>; <i>act directly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(1).780
			</span></i>; esp.<i>farm one's own land,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PTeb.
				302.29
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτήματα -ούμενα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BGU</u>
					475a9
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> c. acc., <i>execute, fulfil of oneself,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἐπὶ τῆς γῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mu.</u>
					398a5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν μαντηΐην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Syr.D.</u>
					36
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἐπιβουλήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
				</span></i>
			
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>VS</u>
				1.21.4
			</span></i>.</div>
